```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title Asset Registry Tagging - Simplified Flow

    box LightBlue Tag Definition
        actor Engineer
        participant PR as PR Review
    end

    box LightGreen Tag Management
        actor Admin as Ops/Admin
        participant Retool as Retool UI
        participant Service as Asset Registry<br/>Service
        participant TagDB as asset_tag<br/>Table
    end

    box LightPink Client Services
        participant Client as AssetTypes<br/>Client (10s)
        participant Cache as Tags Cache
        participant Services
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over Engineer,PR: 1. Tag Definition (One-time)

        Engineer->>PR: Create new tag definition<br/>(REBASING, STABLE, etc.)
        Note right of PR: Tag must have:<br/>- Name (e.g., "REBASING")<br/>- Description<br/>- Behavioral implications
        PR->>Engineer: Merged & deployed ✓
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Admin,TagDB: 2. Apply Tags to Assets

        Admin->>Retool: Select asset tags
        Retool->>Service: SetAssetTags gRPC<br/>(assetTypeID, tags[])
        Service->>TagDB: Insert asset_tag records<br/>(asset_id, tag)
        Note right of TagDB: Unique constraint on<br/>(asset_id, tag) pair<br/><br/>Audit trail via entaudit
        TagDB->>Service: Tags stored ✓
        Service->>Retool: Return current tags
        Retool->>Admin: Success confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Client,Cache: 3. Client Cache Population

        activate Client
        activate Service
        Client->>Service: ListTagsWithAssetTypeIDs gRPC<br/>(every 10s)
        Service->>TagDB: Query all asset_tag records
        TagDB->>Service: Return tag -> assetIDs map
        Service->>Client: Map[tag][]assetTypeIDs
        deactivate Service

        Client->>Cache: Update tagsCache<br/>(sync.Map)
        Note right of Cache: Cache structure:<br/>tagsCache[tag] = []assetTypeIDs<br/><br/>Example:<br/>tagsCache["REBASING"] =<br/>["ethereum:steth", "ethereum:reth"]
        Cache->>Client: Tags cached ✓
        deactivate Client
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over Services,Cache: 4. Service Usage

        activate Services
        activate Client
        Services->>Client: GetByTags("REBASING")
        Client->>Cache: Lookup tag in tagsCache
        Cache->>Client: Return []assetTypeIDs
        Client->>Services: List of rebasing assets
        deactivate Client
        deactivate Services
    end
```
